  "scope": "Windows offline production binaries running on isolated rendering desktops. The wine route makes seven full carts naturally in the published EXE with scripted ordinary orders and four times simulation; one is already moving at the first save. Current build uses a viewport mouse input to send the remaining six in a 960 by 540 window. Shipment, player-ordered rally and settlement after restart are automated at four times speed. The checks cover the wine route and ordinary offline saves using isolated programmatic input.",
